/**
 * @example tutorial.dox
 *
 * End-to-end walk-through of the stereo pipeline. The example below runs the four stages in
 * order and prints what each artefact means.
 *
 * @include demo.cxx
 *
 * @par Description:
 * - Load the configuration: matcher parameters and calibration paths, but never image paths.
 * - Inject the image pair; set_input_image accepts paths or in-memory buffers.
 * - run() rectifies, matches and converts to depth. Nothing is written to disk here.
 * - get_* returns references to the cached results; save_* writes them where the caller asks.
 *
 * @note The point cloud is the expensive artefact, so it is built on the first get_pointcloud()
 * call and cached until the next run().
 */
